WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.201 size:81% position:41% line:92%
Let's get to the news.

00:00:01.201 --> 00:00:02.736 align:start size:94% position:6%
At a rally in Florida
last night,

00:00:02.736 --> 00:00:04.237 line:92%
President Trump falsely claimed

00:00:04.237 --> 00:00:10.110
that photo ID is required to buy
groceries in the United States.

00:00:10.110 --> 00:00:13.813 align:start size:94% position:6%
Dude, what you eatin'
for dinner? Rental cars?

00:00:13.813 --> 00:00:15.382 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:15.382 --> 00:00:18.451 size:84% position:42%
During the same rally,
President Trump claimed

00:00:18.451 --> 00:00:20.487 align:start size:94% position:6%
that he could be
more presidential

00:00:20.487 --> 00:00:22.255 line:92%
than any president in history

00:00:22.255 --> 00:00:27.093
"except for possibly Abe Lincoln
with the big hat."

00:00:27.093 --> 00:00:28.495 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:28.495 --> 00:00:32.032 align:start size:94% position:6%
Oh, right.
That Abe Lincoln.

00:00:32.032 --> 00:00:34.667 align:start size:94% position:6%
Are you at a campaign rally
or show and tell?

00:00:34.667 --> 00:00:38.204 size:88% position:44%
"This is my Abe Lincoln.
He has a really big hat.

00:00:38.204 --> 00:00:41.107 line:92%
And he hates going to plays."

00:00:41.641 --> 00:00:44.811
The New York Mets suffered their
worst loss in franchise history

00:00:44.811 --> 00:00:48.448
last night, losing to the
Washington Nationals, 25-4.

00:00:48.448 --> 00:00:52.118 align:start size:94% position:6%
It was so bad that even
the ceremonial first pitch

00:00:52.118 --> 00:00:54.254 size:78% position:39% line:92%
was hit for a triple.

00:00:54.254 --> 00:00:56.990 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:56.990 --> 00:00:58.324 line:92%
That's right. The New York Mets

00:00:58.324 --> 00:01:00.360 align:start size:94% position:6%
lost to the Washington
Nationals, 25-4.

00:01:00.360 --> 00:01:04.130 size:88% position:44%
It was so embarrassing,
Mr. Met switched jerseys

00:01:04.130 --> 00:01:06.199 size:75% position:38% line:92%
in the third inning.

00:01:06.199 --> 00:01:07.700 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:07.700 --> 00:01:09.202 align:start size:94% position:6%
President Trump
said this morning

00:01:09.202 --> 00:01:11.671 align:start size:94% position:6%
that the Russia investigation
is a hoax, tweeting,

00:01:11.671 --> 00:01:15.108
"The Democrats paid for the
phony and discredited dossier

00:01:15.108 --> 00:01:17.077 align:start size:94% position:6%
which was,
along with Comey, McCabe,

00:01:17.077 --> 00:01:19.679 size:81% position:41%
Strzok, and his lover,
the lovely Lisa Page,

00:01:19.679 --> 00:01:21.514 line:92%
used to begin the witch hunt.

00:01:21.514 --> 00:01:22.415 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Disgraceful."

00:01:22.415 --> 00:01:25.652 size:88% position:44%
And I love that even in
the middle of a meltdown

00:01:25.652 --> 00:01:26.953 size:84% position:42% line:92%
over the investigation,

00:01:26.953 --> 00:01:30.123 align:start size:94% position:6%
he still has time
to hit on a woman.

00:01:30.123 --> 00:01:32.225 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:32.225 --> 00:01:34.928 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:37.230 --> 00:01:40.233 align:start size:94% position:6%
"This is a hoax
and a witch hunt and --

00:01:40.233 --> 00:01:42.168 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Oh, hello, there."

00:01:42.168 --> 00:01:45.472 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:45.472 --> 00:01:47.807 align:start size:94% position:6%
President Trump
also tweeted today,

00:01:47.807 --> 00:01:50.243
"Looking back on history,
who was treated worse?

00:01:50.243 --> 00:01:53.179 align:start size:94% position:6%
Alfonse Capone,
legendary mob boss, killer,

00:01:53.179 --> 00:01:55.949 align:start size:94% position:6%
and 'Public Enemy Number One,'
or Paul Manafort?"

00:01:55.949 --> 00:01:57.784 align:start size:94% position:6%
Hey, man, if you're
trying to convince people

00:01:57.784 --> 00:02:01.121 align:start size:94% position:6%
you're not a mobster,
maybe don't let everyone know

00:02:01.121 --> 00:02:04.124 line:92%
you know Al Capone's full name.

00:02:04.124 --> 00:02:04.791 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:04.791 --> 00:02:07.694
"Why is Robert Mueller treating
me like I'm a worse criminal

00:02:07.694 --> 00:02:12.065 align:start size:94% position:6%
than the legendary
Theodore Robert Bundy?

00:02:12.065 --> 00:02:14.701 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:14.701 --> 00:02:17.470 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Sagittarius."

00:02:17.470 --> 00:02:21.474 align:start size:94% position:6%
Former President Obama
was spotted golfing yesterday

00:02:21.474 --> 00:02:23.309 line:92%
at a country club in Virginia,

00:02:23.309 --> 00:02:25.845 line:92%
unfortunately by this lady.

00:02:25.845 --> 00:02:28.014 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:28.014 --> 00:02:30.817 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Applause ]

00:02:34.954 --> 00:02:41.227
Two sets of identical twins are
set to be married to each other

00:02:41.227 --> 00:02:43.196 line:92%
this weekend in Michigan.

00:02:43.196 --> 00:02:45.598 line:92%
But wait. It gets weirder.

00:02:45.598 --> 00:02:48.468 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:52.572 --> 00:02:54.807 align:start size:94% position:6%
According to a new survey,
women are more

00:02:54.807 --> 00:02:57.610
sexually adventurous when
trying to conceive a child,

00:02:57.610 --> 00:03:00.780 align:start size:94% position:6%
which means you should
definitely not tell your kids

00:03:00.780 --> 00:03:03.516 align:start size:94% position:6%
the story of how
they were conceived.

00:03:03.516 --> 00:03:08.421 size:81% position:41%
"Well, first, your mom
got up on the swing.

00:03:08.421 --> 00:03:11.424 line:92%
I was dressed like a pirate."

00:03:12.392 --> 00:03:15.361 align:start size:94% position:6%
The USDA has issued
a health alert

00:03:15.361 --> 00:03:18.631 align:start size:94% position:6%
over premade salads and wraps
sold at Walgreens

00:03:18.631 --> 00:03:21.467 align:start size:94% position:6%
due to concerns
they may be contaminated

00:03:21.467 --> 00:03:23.236 line:92%
with an intestinal parasite.

00:03:23.236 --> 00:03:25.605 align:start size:94% position:6%
So if you're buying
your meals at Walgreens,

00:03:25.605 --> 00:03:28.741 line:92%
I have even more bad news.

00:03:28.741 --> 00:03:30.743 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:30.743 --> 00:03:33.413 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Applause ]

00:03:36.983 --> 00:03:38.985 align:start size:94% position:6%
Today was National
Girlfriends Day,

00:03:38.985 --> 00:03:43.356 align:start size:94% position:6%
so don't forget
to send her $130,000.

00:03:43.356 --> 00:03:45.425 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

